/** GET /e-pass — The resident's own signed e-pass, HALF AN HOUR AT A TIME (M47 §6): what the phone shows is good for 30 minutes, so a screenshot of it is dead within the half hour, and `slots` is a day of them (48) to keep for a gate with no signal. `valid_from`, `valid_to` and `token` are the half hour this moment is in. The gate code stays the same for the day. Never restricted for a Member or a Dependent; a Helper's works only inside their days and hours (8 Oct 2026: `hours` says them), and not at all while their household has paused them or after their end date. Board resident-app-08. */
